# tests/dockerfile.ci and tests/dockerfile.tests build from the repo root but only
# COPY pyproject.toml + uv.lock (source is checked out / volume-mounted separately).
# Exclude everything else so the 14GB repo (incl. .git) isn't sent as build context.
# The yolov5 Dockerfiles git-clone the repo instead of using context, so they're unaffected.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
